---
interface Props {
  faqContactAnswerText: string;
}

const { faqContactAnswerText } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="faq" class="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <h1 id="faq-heading" class="faq-heading">Frequently asked questions</h1>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h2 class="faq-q">
        What areas does Dr. Jan Duffy serve for Sunstone and Trilogy Sunset real
        estate?
      </h2>
      <p>
        Dr. Jan Duffy works with buyers and sellers across Las Vegas and
        Henderson, with a focus on Sunstone and the Trilogy Sunset community.
        Use the home search on this site to browse current MLS inventory in your
        price range.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h2 class="faq-q">
        How do I search homes for sale in Sunstone or Trilogy Sunset?
      </h2>
      <p>
        Use the RealScout MLS home search on this site to filter by price,
        property type, and listing status. You can adjust the price range and sort
        order to match your goals before you tour homes.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h2 class="faq-q">Which brokerage is Dr. Jan Duffy with?</h2>
      <p>
        Dr. Jan Duffy is licensed in Nevada (S.0197614.LLC) and affiliated with
        Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices Nevada Properties.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h2 class="faq-q">How can I contact Dr. Jan Duffy about buying or selling?</h2>
      <p>{faqContactAnswerText}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="faq-cta">
    Ready to see listings in your range?{" "}
    <a class="faq-cta-link" href="/#browse-listings">Open the home search</a>.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #0a2540;
    --accent-buyer: #3a8dde;
    --box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .faq-section {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .faq-q {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .faq-cta {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .faq-cta-link {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-buyer);
  }
</style>
